{"nodes": [{"label": "v3 \u2014 HERB evaluation harness (README)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-06-22", "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_doc"}, {"label": "Three arms (artifact/lucene/vector): each reads, indexes and ranks the ONE shared corpus with its own code; the only things shared across arms are the corpus on disk and the injected generator - no shared retrieval code, and nothing shared with the artefact (how each uses the corpus is what the comparison measures)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_three_arms"}, {"label": "Shared generator = mistralai/mistral-large-3-675b-instruct-2512 on NVIDIA NIM, injected into every arm (only retrieval varies); multilingual so HERB now and Bonnier later use the same generator, no swap", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_shared_generator"}, {"label": "Decided model stack: shared Mistral-Large generator on NIM + vector embedder nv-embedqa-1b-v2 (multilingual, 8192-ctx); lucene = bm25s lucene-variant; all-MiniLM rejected; every arm scored only by HERB + RAGAS", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_model_stack"}, {"label": "lucene arm built: bm25s method=lucene (Lucene/Elasticsearch BM25 variant, bm25s default; k1=0.9/b=0.4 BEIR reference defaults; reproduces Lucene scoring, Lucene-like analysis not Lucene's Java analyzer); one doc per artifact; artifacts-only index", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_lucene_built"}, {"label": "vector arm BUILT: embedder nv-embedqa-1b-v2 (multilingual, English-strong, 8192-token ctx); reads the corpus with its OWN reader (no code shared with another arm) into one whole artifact per document, embedded entire (no truncation, no chunking - its own unit choice); exact brute-force cosine (no ANN); each artifact keeps its native id so context_ids land in the gold-citation id space (a property of the data, not of shared code); a capable multilingual dense baseline, not English-only all-MiniLM", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_vector_design"}, {"label": "Question ids minted deterministically (HERB has no native id): <product>::a|u::<index>; record {id,question,type,ground_truth,citations} with NO answerable field (a/u lives only in the id); 1514=815+699 unique, the paired-test join key; questions.load_questions hydrates from raw with an exact fail-loud id filter; emits output/question_ids[.answerable|.unanswerable].jsonl {id,type,question} views", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_question_ids"}, {"label": "Two scorers: HERB exact (anchor) + RAGAS (multidimensional lens)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_two_scorers"}, {"label": "Context precision/recall computed deterministically against gold citations, not the judged variants", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_deterministic_ctx"}, {"label": "Data split: corpus oracle-stripped (pipelines see only this) vs raw (truth read in place)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_quarantine_split"}, {"label": "Raw per-question EvalResult (tidy long, nothing pre-aggregated) + RunConfig provenance", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_metricscore_tidy"}, {"label": "Caveat: answer-level scoring measures the whole pipeline; deterministic ctx keeps an endpoint on retrieval", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_construct_validity"}, {"label": "Open: judge (re-run baselines if not GPT-4o), top-k value, question set, judge calibration", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "v3_readme_open_decisions"}], "edges": [{"relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0, "source": "v3_readme_two_scorers", "target": "eval_herb_rationale_1"}, {"relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0, "source": "v3_readme_two_scorers", "target": "eval_ragas_rationale_1"}, {"relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.8, "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0, "source": "v3_readme_question_ids", "target": "v3_orchestrator_rationale_1"}, {"relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.8, "source_file": "v3/README.md", "source_location": null